<title>ARGENTINA: South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</title>
<headline>South American weekly vegoil, subproduct prices.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South American vegoil and subproduct export offer/bid prices at close October 18 as quoted by the J.J. Hinrichsen brokerage (in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>ARGENTINA, FOB Argentine ports</p>
<p>Peanutoil  Nov/Dec 800/- Jan/Mar 820/790</p>
<p> Soy oil    Nov/Dec -15/-30 Nov/Jan -15/-30 May/Jul -140/-160</p>
<p> Sunoil     Oct 500/492 Nov/Dec 505/497</p>
<p>Linsd oil  Oct 480/477</p>
<p>Ctnsd oil  unq  </p>
<p>Soy plts  Nov -7/-9 Dec -4/-7 Jan/Mar 3/1 May/Sep -28/-30</p>
<p> Sunplts   Nov/Dec 135/125 Jan/Mar 130/125 Apr/Jun 125/120</p>
<p>Ctn plts  Oct 160/145 Nov 165/150</p>
<p>Lin expl  Jan/Mar 230/-</p>
<p>Brazil, FOB Paranagua</p>
<p>Soy plts  Nov +14/+12 Nov/Dec +16/+14 Jan +18/+16</p>
<p>	     May/Sep -17/-19</p>
<p>Parana-Rotterdam freight was steady from last week at $16 a tonne FISTLO.</p>
<p>--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
